sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as User / Demo Page
    participant O as Orchestrator
    participant S as SalesRec Workflow
    participant MCP as MCP Server
    participant SQL as Azure SQL
    participant CDB as Cosmos DB
    participant AIS as AI Search
    participant MINI as GPT-4o-mini
    participant GPT as GPT-5.2

    U->>O: POST /sales/recommendation
    O->>S: generate_recommendation(customer_id)

    rect rgb(232, 245, 233)
    Note over S,CDB: Step 1 - Fetch Customer Data
    S->>MCP: query_customer_persona(id)
    MCP->>SQL: SELECT re_summary_text
    SQL-->>MCP: Persona text
    MCP-->>S: persona_text

    S->>MCP: query_call_summary(id)
    MCP->>CDB: Query call-transcripts
    CDB-->>MCP: Call summary
    MCP-->>S: call_summary
    end

    rect rgb(255, 243, 224)
    Note over S,AIS: Step 2 - LLM-Driven Dynamic RAG Query
    S->>MINI: Analyze persona + call_summary
    Note right of MINI: Generate targeted query
    MINI-->>S: Membership query (50-150 chars)
    S->>MCP: search_membership_card(query)
    MCP->>AIS: Vector search ragindex
    AIS-->>MCP: Membership card docs
    MCP-->>S: membership_info
    end

    rect rgb(252, 228, 236)
    Note over S,GPT: Step 3 - GPT-5.2 Generate Script
    S->>S: Assemble prompt (persona + call + membership)
    S->>GPT: chat.completions.create(gpt-52)
    Note right of GPT: Reasoning ~30-60s
    GPT-->>S: Sales recommendation script
    end

    S-->>O: {recommendation, debug}
    O-->>U: JSON Response
